{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测 foomatic-rip 子进程主动联网，关联 CVE-2024-47176 等 CUPS 漏洞。对应需求：打印服务被打后执行。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.network*","logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux打印组件子进程异常联网（CUPS漏洞）","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nfoomatic-rip 子进程出现网络连接。\n\n### 为何重要\n未授权 IPP/UDP 可导致任意命令执行。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 查 631 端口入站与打印机配置是否被改。\n2. 核对进程树与落地文件。\n3. 关联同主机其他 CUPS 规则。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/cups-overflow","https://www.evilsocket.net/2024/09/26/Attacking-UNIX-systems-via-CUPS-Part-I/","https://gist.github.com/stong/c8847ef27910ae344a7b5408d9840ee1","https://github.com/RickdeJager/cupshax/blob/main/cupshax.py"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"e80ee207-9505-49ab-8ca8-bc57d80e2cab","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络事件）。\n2. 确认 `logs-endpoint.events.process*` 有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 命令与控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 漏洞利用"],"type":"eql","query":"sequence by host.id with maxspan=10s\n  [process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action == \"exec\" and\n   process.parent.name == \"foomatic-rip\" and\n   process.name in (\"bash\", \"dash\", \"sh\", \"tcsh\", \"csh\", \"zsh\", \"ksh\", \"fish\")] by process.entity_id\n  [network where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n   event.action == \"connection_attempted\"] by process.parent.entity_id\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.004","name":"Unix Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"}]},{"id":"T1203","name":"Exploitation for Client Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1203/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0010","name":"Exfiltration","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0010/"}}],"false_positives":["极少见；仅核对立刻发生的合法打印机配置变更"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":7,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
